{"unit_id":"tuogusa__dsh-session-tags#card-zh","repo":"tuogusa/dsh-session-tags","commit":"4ef4858916ae28fd3caa8c322116bb344396051a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-tags 是面向 DSH Web 的会话管理插件，在设置中增加独立的「会话标签」分区，并由主机端两个 HTTP 路由读写标签。用户可以浏览并打开会话、为单个会话添加或移除标签，也可以按标签或标题搜索；标签会去重并限制长度。它把标签保存在独立的 JSON 文件中，不改写会话日志或内置侧边栏搜索，适合希望给会话分类并快速找回特定任务的 DSH Web 用户。插件通过 DSH Web 主机的 webServer 提供接口；可用 DSH_HOME 指定数据目录，默认使用 ~/.dsh。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:50-123","lib/client.js:125-142","lib/index.js:80-142","lib/index.js:43-61"]}
{"unit_id":"tuogusa__dsh-session-tags#card-en","repo":"tuogusa/dsh-session-tags","commit":"4ef4858916ae28fd3caa8c322116bb344396051a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-tags adds a Session Tags section to DSH Web settings. Users can browse sessions, add or remove tags, and open a session. Search filters with tag:xxx or matches titles and tags. The host saves tags in a separate JSON file under DSH_HOME, defaulting to ~/.dsh.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:50-123","lib/client.js:125-142","lib/index.js:80-142","lib/index.js:43-61"]}
