{"unit_id":"tuogusa__dsh-session-tags#caveat-1","repo":"tuogusa/dsh-session-tags","commit":"4ef4858916ae28fd3caa8c322116bb344396051a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-tags 使用前须知：标签会持久化到主机本地的 session-tags.json；设置 DSH_HOME 会改变文件所在目录，默认位置为 ~/.dsh/session-tags.json。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:43-61"]}
