{"unit_id":"tuogusa__dsh-session-tags#readme-2","repo":"tuogusa/dsh-session-tags","commit":"4ef4858916ae28fd3caa8c322116bb344396051a","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-tags README · 功能：- **设置 → 会话标签**：为会话添加/删除标签（chip 形式，自动去重、单标签 ≤32 字符）\n- **tag 搜索**：在会话标签分区内用 `tag:xxx` 按标签搜索会话并直接打开\n- 存储独立于会话日志/查询管线：`$DSH_HOME/session-tags.json`","source":"extracted","section":"功能"}
